''Bonus items to complement the [[Keep on the Borderlands]] adventure pack including a full set of cosmetic equipment and a [[mount]]!''  

The Borderlands Warrior cosmetic set {{Bind|BtA}}. <small>It looks like the official AD&D toy/action figure of Warduke{{Ref|[https://dnd.wizards.com/articles/features/brief-history-warduke Brief History]}}</small>

All of the items will be delivered to each character on your account in a bundle.
* {{Item|Borderlands Warrior Helm}}
* {{Item|Borderlands Warrior Armor}}
* {{Item|Borderlands Warrior Cloak}}
* {{Item|Cosmetic Borderlands Warrior Sword}}
* {{Item|Cosmetic Borderlands Warrior Shield}}
* {{Item|Steed of the Borderlands}}: a black horse, fast speed; {{Bind|BtA}}

In addition to those items in the pack, you'll also receive a {{Item|Medium Ingredients Bag}}. <small>(Prior to the introduction of the mount stable, this was a {{Item|Small Wondrous Mount Bag}}.)</small>


